<title>UK: J.P. Morgan sets 200 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan sets 200 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J.P. MORGAN AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    17.OCT.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.65    PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) FIVE	LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   07.APR.97</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
